  "model_card": {
    "summary": "Final baseline and single-design RoPE/RMSNorm/ReLU²/SwiGLU/tied-table TinyLM variants.",
    "scope": "每項只改一個設計；同資料、batch抽樣、更新數與共有表初值。RoPE移除位置表、SwiGLU新增gate、tied共享表，所以總參數不同；固定的是更新/token預算。",
    "limitations": [
      "Single seed, short training and small fixed datasets do not establish universal architecture or precision superiority.",
      "Vocabulary and update exposure are matched; removing/adding/sharing tables changes parameter counts. No long-context extrapolation was established.",
      "The six variants copy shared same-shape initial tables from one random model, not pre-trained real_text weights. The tied output shares the embedding table and cannot also retain the baseline output initialization; its initial NLL is 43.876472063202975 versus baseline 5.760071164309523.",
      "baseline.pt is the predeclared downstream reference, not the variant with the lowest validation NLL. This short 240-update comparison does not establish universal design superiority."
